{"n":6,"at":"2026-11-11T19:30:00Z","by":"prima-kernel-seed","op":"put","addr":"10.11.21.0056.04","tail":"draft","body":"## Never From Memory\nsource: [01 / Never From Memory], inherited from 00.00.00.0056.01; body is the Director's own words (Prima chat, Nov 2026); why from docs/spec/drafting.md:7\nwhy: A rewrite from memory silently drops what the model did not remember.\n\nCopy it then update don't create from memory.","proposal":"prima-kernel-seed:10.11.21.0056"}
